{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113743","id":3081127193,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc63pkUZ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113743","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113743.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113743.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113743","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113743/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113743/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113743/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e51750968e4c1912dbe14a61a7e74e8a12ce9af7","number":113743,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Improve automated checks for GDExtension compatibility","user":{"login":"Yarwin","id":5611207,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEyMDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611207?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yarwin","html_url":"https://github.com/Yarwin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yarwin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yarwin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yarwin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yarwin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yarwin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yarwin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yarwin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yarwin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yarwin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"closes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113519\r\n\r\nImplements the first proposed solution in this thread, i.e.:\r\n\r\n> We could make a minimal GDExtension (maybe directly in C?) that attempts to load all methods in the `extension_api.json` from the previous minor version and see if any of them fails to load. This feels like the most complete way to test it, because it's not just testing the JSON data, but also the fallback code\r\n\r\nEffect of running said check against Godot 4.5.1-stable:\r\n```\r\n$ ./tests/compatibility_test/run_compatibility_test.py\r\n```\r\n\r\nEffect of running said check against Godot Engine v4.6.dev.custom_build.63e14e13f:\r\n<details>\r\n<summary> Errors </summary>\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ ./tests/compatibility_test/run_compatibility_test.py\r\nCompatibility test failed. Errors:\r\n ERROR: Method 'EditorFileDialog.set_file_mode' has changed and no compatibility fallback has been provided. Please open an issue.\r\n   at: gdextension_classdb_get_method_bind (core/extension/gdextension_interface.cpp:1643)\r\nMethod bind not found: EditorFileDialog.set_file_mode (hash: 274150415)\r\nERROR: Method 'EditorFileDialog.get_file_mode' has changed and no compatibility fallback has been provided. Please open an issue.\r\n   at: gdextension_classdb_get_method_bind (core/extension/gdextension_interface.cpp:1643)\r\nMethod bind not found: EditorFileDialog.get_file_mode (hash: 2681044145)\r\nERROR: Method 'EditorFileDialog.set_access' has changed and no compatibility fallback has been provided. Please open an issue.\r\n   at: gdextension_classdb_get_method_bind (core/extension/gdextension_interface.cpp:1643)\r\nMethod bind not found: EditorFileDialog.set_access (hash: 3882893764)\r\nERROR: Method 'EditorFileDialog.get_access' has changed and no compatibility fallback has been provided. Please open an issue.\r\n   at: gdextension_classdb_get_method_bind (core/extension/gdextension_interface.cpp:1643)\r\nMethod bind not found: EditorFileDialog.get_access (hash: 778734016)\r\nERROR: Method 'EditorFileDialog.set_display_mode' has changed and no compatibility fallback has been provided. Please open an issue.\r\n   at: gdextension_classdb_get_method_bind (core/extension/gdextension_interface.cpp:1643)\r\nMethod bind not found: EditorFileDialog.set_display_mode (hash: 3049004050)\r\nERROR: Method 'EditorFileDialog.get_display_mode' has changed and no compatibility fallback has been provided. Please open an issue.\r\n   at: gdextension_classdb_get_method_bind (core/extension/gdextension_interface.cpp:1643)\r\nMethod bind not found: EditorFileDialog.get_display_mode (hash: 3517174669)\r\nERROR: Index p_which = 1 is out of bounds (popup->get_item_count() = 1).\r\n   at: _select (scene/gui/option_button.cpp:416)\r\n\r\nCompatibility test against Godot4.5-stable failed\r\n```\r\n\r\n</details>","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":580537003,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODA1MzcwMDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdextension","name":"topic:gdextension","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2231593685,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMjMxNTkzNjg1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:tests","name":"topic:tests","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/